    add();add('The candidate class remains H3at’s 1,541 models: ordinary-queen constraints plus zero, one or two D4 leaper orbits among all 55 pairs 1≤a<b≤11. The same eight previously examined sixteen-positive N12 banks and complete N13 target universes are retained. This countermeasure was chosen adaptively after expanded unpenalized likelihood selected a spurious orbit in all eight banks. Exactly one prior was chosen and frozen before its MAP selections were computed; no coefficient search, candidate pruning or threshold tuning occurs.');add()
